The Parking Management System was built for Programming 511 first year first semester as a python program.

# To run program:
1. Download Parking Management system(Programming511) file into local storage and unzip/extract files. 
2. Open any Integrated Development Environments such as Visual Studio that has python intepreter.
3. Open the unzipped file from the IDE environment.
4. Run the "AssignmentProg511{NAPHTAL_JUNIOR}.py" file.

# Project specifications/ assignment requirements.
- The project is a mall payment system for parking fees of three malls.
- Each mall has its own parking rules, fees, and capacity.
- The programm involves allowing customers making an account, login, payment of their parking fees, view history of parking/payments, and ability to logout.
